00:01:02.829 --> 00:01:05.165
Even blurred vision

00:01:05.165 --> 00:01:06.967
If not properly controlled

00:01:06.967 --> 00:01:08.769
Blood sugar will slowly

00:01:08.769 --> 00:01:10.270
damage your blood vessels.

00:01:10.270 --> 00:01:14.074
The risk of heart disease, stroke, and kidney

00:01:14.074 --> 00:01:16.276
disease will increase in the future.

00:01:16.276 --> 00:01:17.844
People with chronically low blood sugar

00:01:17.844 --> 00:01:19.046
It is possible that

00:01:19.046 --> 00:01:20.914
Dizziness, cold sweats, trembling hands

00:01:20.914 --> 00:01:21.682
In the long run

00:01:21.682 --> 00:01:24.151
It can also irritate the heart and blood vessels.

00:01:24.151 --> 00:01:27.588
Risks of arrhythmia or myocardial infarction, etc.

00:01:27.588 --> 00:01:30.057
They are all increasing

00:01:30.057 --> 00:01:31.124
Moreover, immunity

00:01:31.124 --> 00:01:32.259
It will get worse and worse.

00:01:32.259 --> 00:01:34.094
Therefore, low blood sugar

00:01:34.094 --> 00:01:35.829
